OL,3,GNEWSABros announce first tour in a
OL,4,Adecade
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe band Bros have announced their
OL,7,Ffirst tour in a decade.
OL,9,FFormed in Camberley, Surrey, in 1986 by
OL,10,Ftwin brothers Matt and Luke Goss
OL,11,Falongside Craig Logan, the band had
OL,12,Fhits including When Will I Be Famous?,
OL,13,FDrop The Boy and I Owe You Nothing.
OL,15,FLogan left in 1989 and Bros split three
OL,16,Fyears later, although Matt and Luke
OL,17,FGoss reunited in 2017 and have not
OL,18,Ftoured together since.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
