OL,3,GNEWSABros announce first tour in a
OL,4,Adecade
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 10-date tour in 2027 will include a
OL,7,FWembley Arena show, 38 years after Bros
OL,8,Fplayed to 77,000 fans at Wembley
OL,9,FStadium, where they became the youngest
OL,10,Fact to headline the venue at the age of
OL,11,F20.
